        [
          "Rear door contains a midrange and a tweeter wired in parallel.  Frequencies below 160Hz are blocked at the amp. Both are 4 Ohm drivers.  Suggest using either just a midrange or a component system.  There are MANY choices.  The factory tweeter is actually pretty good.",
